  ('6-FCIfFrbud5UFbxFkKVF', 'en', '{"cons":[],"pros":["Good build quality","Comfortable and modern design","Responsive and stable connection"],"summary":"All four reviewers gave the GameSir Nova 2 Lite a perfect score, highlighting its good build quality, comfortable design, and quick response. The controller is easy to set up and offers stable wireless connectivity, making it ideal for long gaming sessions. Its Hall Effect analogs provide increased precision, and compatibility with PC, Switch, Steam, and Android adds to its versatility. Overall, it is highly recommended for gamers seeking quality and performance at a good price.","verdict":"positive","headline":"Highly praised wireless game controller with great build and features"}'::jsonb, 4, 'openai/gpt-4.1-nano', '2026-10-18T13:21:57.151+00:00'),
