  ('EDsF80C-D5-0PNjkimoUA', 'en', '{"cons":["Difficult initial setup"],"pros":["Strong and intuitive vibration","Works well with various games"],"summary":"The Redragon Ephemera controller generally functions well and has strong, intuitive vibration, making it suitable for dynamic games. However, users find the initial setup challenging, though it works well with multiple games afterward. Overall, it receives mixed reviews, with some appreciating its performance and others noting difficulties in configuration.","verdict":"mixed","headline":"Decent gaming controller with some setup and vibration strengths"}'::jsonb, 3, 'openai/gpt-4.1-nano', '2026-10-18T13:23:26.648+00:00'),
