  ('FtG2k55hnondjJjAygWa1', 'en', '{"cons":[],"pros":["Multiple adjustable settings for comfort","Portable and easy to clean","Efficient milk extraction with 3 modes"],"summary":"The ANTUV 2 In 1 Breast Pump receives high praise for its advanced technology, comfort, and portability. Users appreciate its adjustable settings, ease of transport, and efficient milk extraction, making it suitable for daily use. Most reviews highlight its lightweight, quiet operation, and user-friendly design, with only one reviewer giving a slightly lower score for overall satisfaction.","verdict":"positive","headline":"Highly praised portable breast pump with multiple modes and comfort features"}'::jsonb, 4, 'openai/gpt-4.1-nano', '2026-10-18T13:22:03.042+00:00'),
