  ('G400j2Kns0mxaZm4Jk8P3', 'en', '{"cons":["Slightly lower score for robustness in one review"],"pros":["Resistant steel claws","Robust construction","Facilitates installation and removal"],"summary":"The reviews praise this spring compressor for its durability, ease of use, and robust construction. Users find it very useful for installing and removing suspension springs, especially noting the strength of the steel claws and overall reliability. Most reviewers give it a perfect rating, highlighting its effectiveness and quality, with only one slightly lower score for its robustness.","verdict":"positive","headline":"Highly recommended heavy-duty spring compressor for automotive suspensions"}'::jsonb, 4, 'openai/gpt-4.1-nano', '2026-10-18T13:22:01.901+00:00'),
