  ('hhZ3fvALT4ITo394ZEeXW', 'en', '{"cons":["Weak suction for some users","Manual effort can be tiring","Not suitable for all needs"],"pros":["Easy to carry and hygienic","Quiet operation","Good for quick extractions"],"summary":"The Bomba Manual Coletora de Leite Lillo Mamy receives generally positive feedback for its convenience, portability, and ease of cleaning. Many users find it practical for daily use and appreciate its quiet operation. However, some users are disappointed with its suction strength, which they find insufficient for efficient milk extraction, leading them to switch to electric models. Overall, it is valued for its quality and cost-benefit, but experiences vary regarding its performance.","verdict":"mixed","headline":"Practical and easy to clean, but with weak suction for some users"}'::jsonb, 8, 'openai/gpt-4.1-nano', '2026-10-18T13:20:48.687+00:00'),
