  ('HZ18VoQvFiSYT4xch4cwt', 'en', '{"cons":["Price considered high by some","Some users noted the cost could be more justified"],"pros":["Smooth and quiet ride","Sturdy and well-built structure","Good resistance with 13kg inertia wheel"],"summary":"The majority of reviews highlight the bike''s good value, smooth and quiet operation, and sturdy construction. Users appreciate the 13kg inertia wheel, safety features like the heart rate sensor, and the digital monitor. While some mention the price is a bit high, overall, customers are satisfied with its performance and ease of use for daily workouts.","verdict":"positive","headline":"Highly praised spinning bike with excellent features and performance"}'::jsonb, 11, 'openai/gpt-4.1-nano', '2026-10-18T13:20:09.806+00:00'),
