  ('IC9kie_JBWya7cUlgV1hp', 'en', '{"cons":["Thermal insulation could be better"],"pros":["Durable stainless steel construction","Secure sealing and leak-proof lid","Practical quick-flip system"],"summary":"The Stanley Garrafa Térmica Quick Flip Black 710ml receives excellent reviews for its durability, design, and ease of use. Most users appreciate its high-quality stainless steel construction, secure sealing, and practical quick-flip lid, making it suitable for daily use and gifting. While the thermal insulation is generally good, a few users found it doesn''t keep drinks hot as long as expected. Overall, the product offers great value and functionality.","verdict":"positive","headline":"Highly praised for durability and practicality, with minor concerns about thermal insulation"}'::jsonb, 7, 'openai/gpt-4.1-nano', '2026-10-18T13:21:01.905+00:00'),
