  ('PDeYvCuJEgl4rSpyaYkLF', 'en', '{"cons":[],"pros":["Engaging narrative","Detailed setting in Fantome","Great for quick, daily reads"],"summary":"The reviews highlight that ''Adaga e Chama: A cidade de Fantome - vol. 1'' is a well-received urban fantasy novel, appreciated for its detailed setting and engaging narrative. Readers enjoy its quick, direct style, making it perfect for daily reading. The story offers surprising depth and a good balance of fantasy and mystery, leaving most reviewers satisfied.","verdict":"positive","headline":"Engaging and detailed urban fantasy with quick, enjoyable reads"}'::jsonb, 6, 'openai/gpt-4.1-nano', '2026-10-18T13:21:15.934+00:00'),
