  ('PNXnGEL0jawKdkcZ1Ax9M', 'en', '{"cons":["Battery life could be better"],"pros":["Powerful and clear sound","Vibrant light show enhances events","Portable and easy to carry"],"summary":"The JBL PartyBox Stage 320 receives high praise for its powerful sound, attractive design, and vibrant light show, making it ideal for parties and outdoor events. Users appreciate its portability and ease of transport, along with quick delivery and good packaging. While most reviews highlight its performance and features positively, some users mention concerns about battery life. Overall, it is considered a solid choice for those seeking a portable, feature-rich speaker.","verdict":"positive","headline":"Great portable speaker with impressive sound and light effects"}'::jsonb, 12, 'openai/gpt-4.1-nano', '2026-10-18T13:20:00.884+00:00'),
