  ('vW2awHOOPJ08EEh8zwD4f', 'en', '{"cons":["Fragile and poor build quality","Instability for larger monitors","Received with damage"],"pros":[],"summary":"The reviews indicate dissatisfaction with the product''s quality and durability. Several users mentioned that the support appeared fragile, with one even receiving a cracked piece. The stability was also questioned, especially for larger monitors, and the overall build quality was considered poor. Delivery issues were also noted, but the main concern remains the product''s poor construction and reliability.","verdict":"negative","headline":"Low quality and stability issues with the monitor stand"}'::jsonb, 4, 'openai/gpt-4.1-nano', '2026-10-18T13:22:33.597+00:00'),
