  ('wO-fFflgxk7kdA20D7UXQ', 'en', '{"cons":["Predictable plot at times","Lack of depth in some stories","Presentation could be improved"],"pros":["Relatable love stories","Practical reflections on love","Engaging and easy to read"],"summary":"The reviews for ''Confusões do amor'' are generally positive, with an average rating of 4.3 out of 5. Readers appreciate the engaging and relatable narratives, as well as the practical reflections on love and relationships. While some found the stories predictable or lacking depth, most enjoyed the light, informal style and the emotional nuances. The book is recommended for those seeking a quick, insightful read about love''s challenges.","verdict":"positive","headline":"Engaging and relatable love stories with practical insights"}'::jsonb, 10, 'openai/gpt-4.1-nano', '2026-10-18T13:20:14.665+00:00'),
  ('wO-fFflgxk7kdA20D7UXQ', 'pt-BR', '{"cons":["Falta de profundidade em algumas histórias","Pouca originalidade nas narrativas","Diagramação poderia ser melhor"],"pros":["Leitura leve e envolvente","Reflexões práticas e acessíveis","Bom para momentos de descanso"],"summary":"Com uma média de 4,3 estrelas, ''Confusões do amor'' é bem avaliado pelos leitores, que destacam sua abordagem prática, narrativa envolvente e leitura leve. Alguns comentários mencionam que o livro poderia ter mais profundidade e originalidade, mas a maioria recomenda para quem busca reflexões rápidas e acessíveis sobre o amor. É considerado uma leitura agradável e útil para momentos de descanso.","verdict":"positive","headline":"Leitura envolvente e prática sobre amor, com algumas críticas à profundidade"}'::jsonb, 10, 'openai/gpt-4.1-nano', '2026-10-18T13:24:20.005+00:00'),
  ('wP69fySo-NUv94sBbzE6h', 'en', '{"cons":["Uneven grinding affecting preparation","Price considered high by some"],"pros":["Excellent aroma and flavor","Good packaging and freshness","High quality and rich taste"],"summary":"The reviews show that most customers are very satisfied with this Arabica coffee, praising its aroma, flavor, and freshness. While some mention minor issues like uneven grinding and price, the overall impression is very positive, with an average rating of 4.6 out of 5. Many reviewers highlight its rich taste and good packaging, making it a popular choice for coffee lovers.","verdict":"positive","headline":"High-quality Arabica coffee with great aroma and flavor"}'::jsonb, 10, 'openai/gpt-4.1-nano', '2026-10-18T13:20:13.409+00:00'),
  ('wP69fySo-NUv94sBbzE6h', 'pt-BR', '{"cons":["Moagem não uniforme","Preço um pouco alto"],"pros":["Aroma irresistível","Sabor rico e encorpado","Boa embalagem e frescor mantido"],"summary":"Os reviews destacam a alta qualidade do café, com aroma irresistível e sabor encorpado, ideal para apreciadores de um bom arábica. A embalagem mantém o frescor e a entrega é rápida, embora alguns mencionem que a moagem poderia ser mais uniforme e o preço um pouco elevado. No geral, a maioria dos consumidores está satisfeita com o produto.","verdict":"positive","headline":"Café Arábica de alta qualidade com aroma e sabor excelentes"}'::jsonb, 10, 'openai/gpt-4.1-nano', '2026-10-18T13:24:18.495+00:00'),
  ('xgWy2JmIbUaTFBxZly4FC', 'en', '{"cons":["Poor antiaderente durability","Coating wears out quickly","Not resistant to frequent use on induction"],"pros":["Good capacity for cooking various foods","Safety lock functions well"],"summary":"The Panela De Pressão 4,4L has a decent capacity and functions well for cooking, but the non-stick coating quickly deteriorates and shows signs of wear after only a few weeks of use. Despite its attractive appearance, the durability of the antiaderente is lacking, and the overall user experience has been disappointing. The safety lock works well, but the coating''s poor resistance to frequent use on induction hobs is a significant drawback.","verdict":"negative","headline":"Disappointing non-stick coating and durability issues"}'::jsonb, 3, 'openai/gpt-4.1-nano', '2026-10-18T13:23:52.532+00:00'),
